{"ID":"20230928081238-auwnrf8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20230928081238-auwnrf8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928081238-auwnrf8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928081525-42k4dtp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928081853-ebpf7iz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:5442,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928081805-2iiimu7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:15,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"方便法门","type":"doc","updated":"20231218094713"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230928081252-o1zizhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081252-o1zizhd","updated":"20230928081252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、疱疹：患处头尾隔姜灸；蜘蛛网平摊疱疹上，薄薄一层，点火烧，大概四五天就好（小型痘状的疱疹）；或用薄薄一层棉花烧，用凡士林黏住固定；全蝎粉用胶囊吞服，可止疱疹痛；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081252-chs80bp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081252-chs80bp","updated":"20230928081252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、鸡眼：米粒灸（用凡士林固定，哪有鸡眼灸哪，灸3-5个，痛灸到不痛为止，不痛灸到痛为止）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081252-xh1fq3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081252-xh1fq3u","updated":"20230928081252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、脂肪瘤\\脓疱：同鸡眼治法；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081252-bkr2w0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081252-bkr2w0g","updated":"20230928081252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、急救：针灸人中（将人中分为三段，针尖要从从下往上数，第一段与第二段中间，斜向上往脑部位置扎）；掐人中（没有针就掐，大拇指按住人中，往脑部的方向推）；十宣放血法（用放血针针扎十指进行放血；可以一次性抓住五根手指快速刺破把血挤出来），如果十根手指放血还没醒，就足十宣放血，即十根脚趾头尖放血，如果还没醒，就下涌泉穴（如图2）；都不醒的话，百会穴放血（如图三）（适用脑中风，血压上来脸红昏过去）（平躺床上头朝下，头下放一个水桶用于装血）；三寸长针向心脏方向刺入会阴穴（溺水急救，患者采取跪地趴着的姿势）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081252-5yr2rv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081252-5yr2rv1","updated":"20230928081252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人中扎法"}]},{"ID":"20230928081310-ix77qha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081310-ix77qha","updated":"20230928081310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928081310-pxe9iuh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928081312-hfn5vge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081312-hfn5vge","updated":"20230928081317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"涌泉穴位"}]},{"ID":"20230928081331-gdiw0io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081331-gdiw0io","updated":"20230928081331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928081331-2sbqf0w.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928081332-suq93yr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081332-suq93yr","updated":"20230928081339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百会穴（鼻子为准画线，耳尖画线两者交接点，往后差不多半寸，有个小凹穴）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081354-ghq8207","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081354-ghq8207","updated":"20230928081354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928081353-8w0ef0o.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-ohr015p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-ohr015p","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.1、心脏跳停急救：关元穴+巨阙穴+少府穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-alyuobj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-alyuobj","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、脓疡\\烂脚\\乳房脓疡\\疮类：放蚂蝗吸血（也叫吸血虫）（自然界昆虫类，不管苍蝇蚊子，有个天性，喜欢吃腐坏的食物；蚂蝗\\吸血虫的津液还有麻醉作用）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-oibmr2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-oibmr2f","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、火罐：吸脓；淤血；膝盖扭伤、踝关节扭伤（在痛的点放血，放血的颜色变淡就起罐）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-exm21q4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-exm21q4","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、竹子或海胆刺到：可以用火罐吸出来；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-5h564lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-5h564lr","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、动脉血管阻塞：井穴（金）+厉兑穴（非常好用的穴道）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-74sy2cj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-74sy2cj","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、赤白带、尿道发炎：曲骨穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-9ljbzv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-9ljbzv3","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、膀胱上的疾病，小便不出来，小便太多，半夜上厕所，精子稀：中极穴（膀胱之募）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-x148t3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-x148t3r","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、月经痛（痛经）：关元穴（可针可灸）、灸中级穴（可针可灸）；三阴交（立竿见影，著名治痛经大穴）；血海穴（著名治痛经大穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-dr7lu61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-dr7lu61","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.1、禁食生冷；禁止行房；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-b51nlfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-b51nlfy","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、心脏病、心律不齐：针灸关元穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-3x9x1b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-3x9x1b1","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.1、心脏病：足阳明胃经井穴；厉兑穴；心俞穴+巨阙穴（俞募治疗）；公孙+内关，关元、巨阙、天突；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-6ead37z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-6ead37z","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13、阴汗湿痒（阴部湿痒）：阴交穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-riaqh51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-riaqh51","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14、中风、肠鸣、肠道疾病：灸神阙穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-anexk63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-anexk63","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15、中脘穴：胃的问题导致的印堂痛；怀孕过程妊娠的恶心呕吐；食物中毒呕吐；胃病相关；胃下垂；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-p728qyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-p728qyt","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16、一切胃病（吐血禁用）：梅花灸，以中脘穴为主，上下左右各一寸各方五片生姜，在上面灸；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-0rq5x6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-0rq5x6p","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17、檀中穴：气病；肺痈吐脓，呕吐涎沫，妇人乳汁变少；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-kwpvwrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-kwpvwrj","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"18、心痛彻背，背痛彻心或心肌梗塞、心脏动脉血管类的心脏强痛：天突穴+巨阙穴+关元穴（常用心脏病的三个穴道，几乎无所不治，无补泻）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-zmtei9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-zmtei9r","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"19、廉泉穴：舌强不语；舌头相关的病；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-gns84zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-gns84zx","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20、承浆穴：吃了饭流涎沫； 牙齿痛"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-43c3flk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-43c3flk","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"21、面部中风，脸歪一边，面孔回正后：下承浆穴+人中穴，多下几次，把它固定住；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-9uzath4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-9uzath4","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"22、角弓反张，脑膜炎：命门穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-i1t4s1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-i1t4s1g","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"23、黄胆、便血：针灸脊中穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-2b8uylm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-2b8uylm","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"24、抽筋、癫狂、癫痫狂：筋缩穴（可针不可灸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-ff9fmom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-ff9fmom","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"25、糖尿病：消渴穴；阳池穴（消渴、口渴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-i0al0fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-i0al0fa","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"26、长高、常感冒体质：艾灸身柱穴；dssdds"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-gkmxar0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-gkmxar0","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"26.1、长高，增高：太乙穴；滑肉门穴；灸脾俞穴+身柱穴（开胃又增高，效果更好）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081403-y3n35l1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081403-y3n35l1","updated":"20230928081403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"27、喑哑、声音发不出来：哑门穴（患者向枕而躺，针刺哑门对着舌根的方向往里刺，针下的很深，扎到正位时，病人舌头会吐出；如图，勿轻易下针）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081419-xzebf9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081419-xzebf9g","updated":"20230928081419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928081419-i109gcg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-eqynb9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-eqynb9d","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"28、头项强痛、中风、舌强：风府穴（可针不可灸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-b6hrn1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-b6hrn1n","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"29、百会穴：百病皆治（遇到疑难杂症，可尝试百会穴）；中风；癫痫；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-9029upy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-9029upy","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30、鼻窦炎：上星穴（米粒灸；分开头发用凡士林固定艾粒，灸7-9状，灸完会有个疤）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-f9fdwbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-f9fdwbr","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"31、酒槽鼻、鼻息肉：素髎穴（点刺放血）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-h9j0mel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-h9j0mel","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"32、消渴、饮饮、饮水无度、口歪眼斜，面目中风，癫痫，面肿：水沟穴（人中）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-o8cbtpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-o8cbtpe","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"33、牙痛，牙龈肿，腐烂，牙周病，鼻窦：龈交穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-viimh4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-viimh4a","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"33.1、上牙痛：下手阳明大肠经；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-v3b6jd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-v3b6jd3","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"33.2、下牙痛：下足阳明胃经；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-o0hyz3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-o0hyz3v","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"34、补气：薤白粥加羊肾来炖（没有羊肾用猪腰也行）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-9pisb2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-9pisb2a","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"35、肺咳嗽久咳、气喘：中府刺到云门穴（一针透两穴，不要刺进肋骨）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-ds5onav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-ds5onav","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"36、不论证，任何情况的流鼻血：天府穴（对称疗法，左鼻流血扎右边，右鼻流血扎左边），如天府没能止住，再加扎侠白穴增加效果；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-xj9b1m4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-xj9b1m4","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"37、痔疮，大便带血，咳嗽带血（有炎症，舌苔黄口渴）：孔最穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-7pvyprh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-7pvyprh","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"38、任脉疾病如阴茎痛、喉咙痛：列缺穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-0ddwmz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-0ddwmz7","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"39、肺家虚症：太渊穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-jb5vnmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-jb5vnmk","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"40、扁桃腺发炎、小孩发烧\\退烧：少商穴（点刺放血），如不退烧再加商阳穴放血，再不退大椎穴放血；支沟穴+照海穴（便秘导致的高烧）；扁桃腺也能放血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-0gvk6kr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-0gvk6kr","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"41、风湿关节肿痛，指节不能握拳：三间穴透到劳宫穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-a9gy6bs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-a9gy6bs","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"42、脸上油多、青春痘、美白美容：灸合谷穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-q13urrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-q13urrz","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"43、曲池穴：肚脐以上的消炎穴，如皮肤痒，最好是合谷和曲池同时下针，下针即见效；（曲池+合谷，最有名的皮肤止痒穴道）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-9q7y8pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-9q7y8pd","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"44、面部中风，口部疾病：合谷穴（面口合谷收，面部口部疾病可从合谷穴对治）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-mjwjh42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-mjwjh42","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"45、腰闪到、扭伤、落枕等扭伤：手三里穴（下针后慢慢拧针并让病人慢慢活动扭伤处）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081427-7b82agu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081427-7b82agu","updated":"20230928081427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"46、落枕：落枕扭伤后，躺回床上，头靠床尾慢慢垂下，自然呼吸三到五分钟，再慢慢枕到床上放平，慢慢坐起来就好了；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081440-5bkvtou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081440-5bkvtou","updated":"20230928081440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928081440-z5a1t5f.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928081446-90k5d5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081446-90k5d5r","updated":"20230928081458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（日常生活中，不管是扭伤摔伤滑伤都要注意，真正受伤是事后不是事前，所以摔下去之后，是受伤的时候起来太快受伤的；所以一旦摔倒，保持原姿势在原地不要动，让身体去适应这个姿势，大概三分钟再站起来，身体就不会受伤）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081455-zki4mzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081455-zki4mzq","updated":"20230928081455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"47、手中风，手掌不能伸张：合谷透后溪穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081455-b3r043f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081455-b3r043f","updated":"20230928081455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"48、狐臭：肩髃穴透极泉穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081455-57qlulo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081455-57qlulo","updated":"20230928081455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"49、两边鼻孔不通、鼻窦炎：迎香穴；迎香穴透内迎香穴（提前在对侧合谷下针，不然很疼），见效极快；上星灸（米粒灸上星穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081512-cqbc21k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081512-cqbc21k","updated":"20230928081512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928081512-hdol96c.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-plxv6mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-plxv6mr","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50、中耳炎：下关穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-61d27l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-61d27l8","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"51、地仓穴透颊车穴：面部中风、口歪眼斜；牙关不开，口噤不语失音；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-gcqsxwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-gcqsxwy","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"52、脸部麻痛或拔完牙后脸部麻痛：下针巨髎穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-rv9yg0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-rv9yg0p","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"53、乳涨奶排不出来：拿根葱切开，先用葱白部分擦拭乳头（葱白辛辣发散），涂了以后反过来用葱的尾巴刺激乳头，奶水就出来了；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-b7tqhyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-b7tqhyu","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"54、乳房硬块：膺窗穴（胃经）；乳根穴（胃经）；天溪穴（脾经）；初期硬块，灸比针好；天应穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-3gbe9ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-3gbe9ze","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"55、丰胸：膺窗穴；乳根穴；丰隆穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-04ba1v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-04ba1v1","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"56、涨奶堵住了，产生硬块（奶水是心脏在管）：吸出来；胸部按摩推出奶水；在硬块的地方放块姜，放艾绒上去烧（初期）；用针（看硬块在哪，如在胃经上，则在胃经上的子穴母穴根据虚或实症消导掉）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-uoge3uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-uoge3uf","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"56.1、女性进入更年期后，原本奶水从月经排出，经停后从大便排出，如便秘，则胸就会变得胀大；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-vgypz4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-vgypz4p","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"57、丰胸：膺窗穴；乳根穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-8p2mmzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-8p2mmzk","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"58、吃东西或喝水导致胃很胀很难过：针灸不容穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-cnhmlnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-cnhmlnn","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"59、吃一点东西就饱，腹满积食：承满穴；中脘穴加旁开两寸的周边穴位辅助；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-1f0sudy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-1f0sudy","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"60、便秘：天枢穴（寒症用灸，热症用针）；灸左右天枢穴，针中脘穴+关元穴（小便淡白，寒症，肠胃同治）；针左右天枢穴，针中脘穴+关元穴（小便深黄，热症，肠胃同治）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-0kbscs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-0kbscs7","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"61、水肿很厉害：水分穴+水道穴；涌泉穴；太溪穴；水泉穴；三皇穴+太冲穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-t3zuz0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-t3zuz0j","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"62、睾丸收缩入腹：针灸归来穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-knatrqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-knatrqw","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"63、助孕，更易怀孕（艾灸）：中级穴、气冲穴、关元穴、归来穴；商丘穴；涌泉穴；三阴交；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-17udjjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-17udjjv","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"63.1、绝孕（灸）：石门穴；阴交穴；绝孕穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-42k4dtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-42k4dtp","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"64、手脚痉挛、抽筋、无力，脚膝冷：伏兔穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-h2hvpzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-h2hvpzj","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"65、膝盖冰冷、脚痛膝盖痛：阴市穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-pzzzx9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-pzzzx9w","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"66、伤在膝盖：梁丘穴（膝盖常动，受伤或化脓不易好转，梁丘穴可对治）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-550subz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-550subz","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"67、风湿关节炎膝盖伤痛：鹤顶穴+膝眼穴（两个，直进直出如雀啄术，不捻针，捻针的话会把油腻刺破膝盖受伤）+阳陵泉透阴陵泉（五穴四针，治所有膝盖的问题）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-wh51vea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-wh51vea","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"68、一切胃病包括恶心呕吐、脚无力：足三里；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-ucsw141","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-ucsw141","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"69、灸关元阳火过剩身体燥热发干：灸足三里，可以让阳火降下来；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-8q1p406","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-8q1p406","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"70、血压高，面部涨红，阳明热：足三里下五分，从下往上斜刺入足三里穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-y83j91v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-y83j91v","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"71、长寿法：常灸足三里（有胃气则生，无胃气则死）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-hnbuhtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-hnbuhtc","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"72、盲肠炎（阑尾炎）判断：按压阑尾穴，有压痛感即为盲肠炎（男按左、女按右）；针扎阑尾穴，引导气即可，无所谓补泻；（如痛消除掉，可针对情况下大肠募穴天枢穴或小肠募穴关元穴把炎症清除掉）（阑尾穴，位于足三里下一寸）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-w88o0va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-w88o0va","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"72.1、盲肠炎之所以痛，是因为红肿压力导致；如果盲肠炎患处肿破了，大便就漏出来到腹腔，患者会觉得痛感消失，以为好了；实际是痛感变了，一动就痛；（中医判断腹膜炎，摸腹部上下，上下凉，中间热烫，说明发炎，有腹膜炎）：天府穴、中脘穴、关元穴、阑尾学都可以下针对治；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-f91dgx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-f91dgx7","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"73、乳房硬块、乳癌：上巨虚穴（粗狂理解，肚脐以上巨大的东西让它虚掉）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-8gmw1q3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-8gmw1q3","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"74、肚脐以下有硬块如（子宫瘤、卵巢瘤、腹部瘤、结块瘤）：下巨虚穴；（肚脐以下巨大的东西让它虚掉）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-8qx2g17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-8qx2g17","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"75、脚麻（麻掉没有痛感）：条口穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-9d6hn9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-9d6hn9p","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"76、五十肩：条口穴透承山穴（三寸针，一边透针一边让患者抬手）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-33j4dr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-33j4dr8","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"77、丰隆穴：丰胸（补的方式，泻的方式则为瘦胸）；祛痰（好用的祛痰穴位；导痰手法：下针后拧针到有气感，把针慢慢提起来到皮层有一点点连到，然后倒下来45度，对着身体的方向下针并捻针，病人感到酸麻感了，再慢慢提起到皮层，再用往下45度方向下针，留针20分钟）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081525-81r4ncu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081525-81r4ncu","updated":"20230928081525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"78、中风有预兆：手前三根手指麻（现象出现大概六月内会中风），如在胃经上，足三里、上巨虚、下巨虚、丰隆穴麻时可能两周内中风，这时治法是灸足三里穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081535-7wynsyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081535-7wynsyi","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20230928081557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"79、五脏逼毒法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081535-ehljyvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081535-ehljyvh","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20230928081558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"79.1、（肺毒）：手指交叉尽量往上抬，脚尖着地；手掌上升时肋骨会往上升，上升同时胸腔好像会被压住，这个时候发出‘呬’的声音，发到彻底没有气了，再而提肛，发最后一个无声的呬；最后一步很重要；（如做对了，头会暝眩）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081535-9v27byo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081535-9v27byo","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20230928081605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"79.2、脾之音为‘宫’；宫的音就是呼吸的‘呼’；（方法：手挨着脾脏的地方如左肋，两手按住，呼气的时候，脾开窍在唇，所以把嘴唇呼成圆形，呼到没气了，把肛门提起来，用身体的内力把所有的气都呼出来）（如做对了，头会暝眩）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081535-y8mgbap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081535-y8mgbap","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20230928081608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"79.3、心之音为‘徴’，徴的音就是‘呵’；（方法：找一面混凝土或硬墙，先调息，然后背靠撞墙，撞上去之后，大力把气吐出来，发出‘呵’的声音；功夫深的话，即撞到墙同时，把气吐光）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081535-ooqa9rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081535-ooqa9rj","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20230928081610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"79.4、肾之音为‘羽’，羽的音就是‘吹；（方法：双手往后压到两个肾脏处，身体前倾，一只脚前一只脚后，吸一口气，‘吹’这个声音发出去；气没有了，再提肛，把最后一口气‘吹’出）’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081535-ilngk52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081535-ilngk52","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","updated":"20230928081611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"79.5、肝之音为‘呼’，呼的音就是‘嘘’，（方法：双手捂住肝脏位置，自然放松吸气，然后嘴巴发‘嘘’声把气发出去，嘘到没气时，再提肛，最后发一个无声的‘嘘’，将所有气逼出）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081535-l1u3s5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081535-l1u3s5r","updated":"20230928081553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79.6、三焦逼毒法，发的音就是‘嘻’，（方法：舌头顶着牙齿，嘴巴稍微张开，三焦经在手上第二个指头，到我们的肩背、到耳朵周围，三焦经发音‘嘻’时双掌撑开向前推，断断续续地发出‘嘻’声，一段段‘嘻’的时候力道会慢慢深入脏腑之中； 最后‘嘻’到没有声音的时候，脚要踮起来，踮起来的目的是因为手有三阴三阳，脚有三阴三阳，所以手指头往前伸，脚踮起筋络就会拉紧，发‘嘻’声就会把内在的劲道发出来，最后一口气时提肛，发最后一声‘嘻’）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081535-zde8swk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081535-zde8swk","updated":"20230928081535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"80、脾在声为哕（打嗝）：如果病重一直打嗝，说明快不行了，要治脾；大都穴下针（虚症）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-ms60gje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-ms60gje","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"81、尸厥、昏迷、腹部的妇科如白带、滴漏不止：隐白穴（妇科止血大穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-sc1wagd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-sc1wagd","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"82、疝气、肠子下坠：肝经井穴或脾经井穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-opa3e6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-opa3e6f","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"83、失眠：灸三毛穴；灵道透到通里、阴郄、神门穴；安眠穴（奇穴，天柱穴外开一寸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-p0o37qc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-p0o37qc","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"84、公孙穴+内关穴：治胃、心、胸一切所有病；（如胃痉挛，效果极快，立竿见影）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-mxblm6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-mxblm6e","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"85、公孙穴：妇女怀孕妊娠恶心呕吐；冲脉覆盖到得病；腹胀；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-8qnjuh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-8qnjuh5","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"86、三阴交：足少阴肾经、足太阴脾经、 足厥阴肝经三经交汇点；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-2xbc2s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-2xbc2s1","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"87、灸三阴交：腹部寒冷；脚冷；遗精；阴茎痛；腹部痛；水肿；脚积水；更年期；妇科相关；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-ems4dxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-ems4dxd","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"88、尿频：灸关元；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-bwm2sch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-bwm2sch","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"89、水肿：水肿治疗角度不仅要消水，还要强土，因为土克水；2三阴交+2地机穴+2阴陵泉（也就是三皇穴；针完出针的时候下针位置会流水，让它流，不会发炎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-dbyg0ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-dbyg0ff","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"90、肌肉无力时：三皇穴（三皇穴是指三阴交（人）、地机穴（地）、阴陵泉（人）三个穴，三穴六针）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-lr0xtlc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-lr0xtlc","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"91、阴陵泉：膝盖风湿、水肿、膝盖痛、小便失禁、尿频、常夜尿、摄护腺肥大、"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-oc84nxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-oc84nxm","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"92、体内有虫：百虫窝穴（针灸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-q8ct4ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-q8ct4ng","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"93、妇人生完小孩后胎盘下不来：冲门穴；昆仑穴；太溪穴；中极穴；关元穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-7ny99lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-7ny99lr","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"94、脏腑之间，全身经络不能沟通：大包穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-xbbsej8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-xbbsej8","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"95、神门穴：惊悸、心脏动悸、失眠；情志方面；见鬼发笑；（让心定下来）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-h33vff3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-h33vff3","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"96、前谷穴：奶水不足；下午1点到三点精神不好（前谷穴痛也可扎俞穴即后溪穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-lb2c6tx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-lb2c6tx","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"97、养老穴：视物不明；白内障；近视眼；眼睛不好；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-4wvymi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-4wvymi1","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"98、养老穴透间使穴（不留针）：手肘不能拧毛巾；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-s3eu07u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-s3eu07u","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"99、内急、腹痛：肠关穴（手按压，男左女右）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-5v3cunr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-5v3cunr","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"100、肝癌、肝疼痛：肝关穴（对称治法，左痛右治，右痛左治）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-t34jup9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-t34jup9","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"101、心脏痛：心关穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-12zakts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-12zakts","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"102、肩膀酸痛、项强：肩中俞；肩外俞；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-vexi509","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-vexi509","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"103、听宫穴/耳门/听会穴（张嘴才能出现听宫穴；留针三五分钟）：耳朵化脓；耳朵发炎；耳鸣；听力差；中耳炎；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-q7rcetj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-q7rcetj","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"104、睛明穴（可针不可灸）：视力模糊；青光眼；白内障；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-xsnht81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-xsnht81","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"105、增强视力、白内障、角膜炎、结膜炎、眼睛累：攒竹穴放血；眉尾穴；瞳子髎穴；耳尖穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-ycrst27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-ycrst27","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"106、眼睛对光线敏感：承光穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-2p3w9c5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-2p3w9c5","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"107、鼻窦炎、鼻塞、闻不到气味：合谷穴+通天穴（加迎香穴更好）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081620-gq8y704","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081620-gq8y704","updated":"20230928081620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"108、头昏（内耳不平衡）：稳中焦，中焦如天平底座（如巨阙、中脘、公孙内关止呕）；络却穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081631-28s3stu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081631-28s3stu","updated":"20230928081631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928081631-q6vrl8d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928081635-v8oi1a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081635-v8oi1a3","updated":"20230928081643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"109、头痛：玉枕穴（近取穴，头皮和头骨之间）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081651-n88212e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081651-n88212e","updated":"20230928081657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"110、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大抒穴（陶道穴外开一寸半，骨之会，可针可灸）：骨病治此；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928081651-fabd2hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081651-fabd2hs","updated":"20230928081651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"110.1、郄穴治疗案例：如骨裂位置是手阳明大肠经跟手太阴肺经交接在这个骨头管；针下大抒穴，再从郄穴下针如手阳明大肠经的郄穴温溜穴+头太阴肺经郄穴孔最穴，下针以后止痛同时让骨头恢复；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-n73dbae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-n73dbae","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"111、五脏气乱（如高处摔下导致脏腑气乱）：天柱穴+大抒穴（不补不泻）；深取足通谷穴+束骨穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-vt27sqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-vt27sqy","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"112、背长痈疽、脓块（ 红肿白头；白色无头；凹陷）：第一种痛灸到不痛；第二种不痛灸到痛；风门穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-q61lv5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-q61lv5d","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"113、褥疮（躺床上太久背上生褥疮）：灸风门穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-v3shpac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-v3shpac","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"114、肺俞穴（忧伤肺）：肺萎缩；皮肤痒；欲自杀；抑郁症；小儿龟背；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-a4typby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-a4typby","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"115、心俞穴（可针可灸）:小孩子正常岁数不会讲话（心气不足）；健忘；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-4t2qj33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-4t2qj33","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"116、红斑性狼疮：心俞穴、肺俞穴、肝俞穴（针灸，治疗过程中，关节痛会一直退）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-z967k62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-z967k62","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"116.1、心脏其华在面，红斑性狼疮属心脏问题，心火可脾土，脾主四肢所以会关节痛；红斑性狼疮一般患者女人居多，因为女人奶水在上，男人‘奶水’在下，女人奶水储藏位靠近心脏，所以情志病导致奶水堵塞容易对心造成影响；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-ib4v5qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-ib4v5qs","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"117、督俞穴（管督脉）:"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-mljkbl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-mljkbl8","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"118、膈俞穴（血会膈俞）：贫血、淤血、内脏出血、任意血病包括出血的病；活血化瘀；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-famx81w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-famx81w","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"118.1、口渴又不想喝水，这种情况是身上有淤血导致的；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-c64gqp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-c64gqp2","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"119、消渴穴（奇穴，可针可灸）：上消中消下消；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-zs5mhqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-zs5mhqg","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"120、肝俞穴：肝病治此；积聚痞痛，肿瘤硬块之类都可对治；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-rvfuj7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-rvfuj7p","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"121、胆俞穴：胆病治此；肺痨（全身发黄，病因是金克木）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-xcomnse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-xcomnse","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"121.1、肺痨：吃杏仁的核仁；四花灸（膈俞穴+胆俞穴共四穴艾灸）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-f42louv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-f42louv","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"122、脾俞穴：四肢的问题都可对治；风湿关节痛亦可；腹部水肿鼓胀（土克水）；开胃；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-u2g1134","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-u2g1134","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"123、胃俞穴：胃病治此；胃经的募穴中脘穴+胃俞穴（俞募治疗）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-gyk8i3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-gyk8i3d","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"123.1、胃痛：梁丘穴是胃经郄穴，腑会中脘穴，中脘穴+梁丘穴（会郄治疗法）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-p7f5d3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-p7f5d3u","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"123.2、一切胃病：会郄治疗法+俞募治疗法+足三里"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-f16vm2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-f16vm2t","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"124、三焦俞穴：三焦病；水的问题（下痢、大便带血、水肿，消化能力差）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-vs0x4a2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-vs0x4a2","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"124.1、三焦经的募穴，是石门穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-qvnahv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-qvnahv5","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"125、肾俞穴：耳鸣耳聋听力差；健忘；糖尿病的下消；肾俞穴附近腰痛；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-6npdpnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-6npdpnq","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"125.1、肾藏志，肾主骨，肾管耳；肾管大小便（肾衰的人，常用多便的现象）；肾主水；（如两腿发肿，是肾脏问题，如腿没肿，只有脚关节肿，是心脏问题）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-barse0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-barse0i","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"127、大肠俞穴：大肠问题，腰痛便秘都可治疗；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-iy3wcwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-iy3wcwp","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"128、小肠俞穴：小肠问题，痔疮，腰痛都可治疗；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-hu9tqzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-hu9tqzd","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"129、膀胱俞穴：小便失禁；妇科病；腰痛；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-2r05agf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-2r05agf","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"130、中膂俞穴：肾虚；消渴病；大小便问题；赤带白带；腰痛；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-qh7873u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-qh7873u","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"131、白环俞穴：疝气；大小便问题；腰痛；赤带白带；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-cxc5sim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-cxc5sim","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"132、上髎穴：统治所有腰痛，不管腰痛在哪，都可对治；妇人不孕；阴部治症；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-6qwzoa1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-6qwzoa1","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"132.1、八髎穴统归上髎穴管；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-xxmsm9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-xxmsm9x","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"133、次髎穴：阴茎痛；睾丸痛；腰以下脚麻；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-c0m1xjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-c0m1xjx","updated":"20230928081705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"134、中髎穴：妇人不孕；白带多；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081705-kte43cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081705-kte43cx","updated":"20230928081711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"135、下髎穴："}]},{"ID":"20230928081718-335380x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081718-335380x","updated":"20230928081721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"136、膏肓穴："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"无所不疗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；（如灸膏肓燥渴，可灸关元、气海、中极、阴交、足三里让火气下行；灸膏肓过程中，肚子会有水响声）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081718-12bcb7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081718-12bcb7n","updated":"20230928081718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"136.1、膏肓痛，源于身心紧张职业（如FBI，警察犯人之类等），痛起来如螺丝刀钻进去拧痛；如针灸无效，膏肓放血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081718-idhhoe8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081718-idhhoe8","updated":"20230928081731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"136.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"任何重病，不知解法时，灸膏肓穴，配合足三里引火气下行，否则会口舌干燥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081718-ax9bhdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081718-ax9bhdz","updated":"20230928081718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"137、痞根穴（经外奇穴，顾名思义痞块之根，可针可灸）：断肿瘤硬块之根；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081742-d6keuq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081742-d6keuq7","updated":"20230928081742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"137.1、中医认为肿瘤硬块都有一个根，就如树有根；砍树不砍根，树会长回来；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081742-pmp7fnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081742-pmp7fnn","updated":"20230928081742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"138、秩边穴：对各种痔都有疗效；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081742-9sfmokc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081742-9sfmokc","updated":"20230928081742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"139、承扶穴（三寸针，透到骨头上，深针才有效）：坐骨神经痛；背痛；痔疮；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081742-a7lbp08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081742-a7lbp08","updated":"20230928081755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"140、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"委中穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：坐骨神经痛；放血去毒；麻风病；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"背痛（委中是膀胱经母穴，膀胱经覆盖整个背部，所以委中对治背痛效果良好，如果是督脉痛则扎后溪穴）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；皮肤藓；卡波西（艾滋病，肉瘤，肚脐以上长颗颗瘤，常见于同性恋、吸毒，也跟小儿麻痹疫苗有关；委中放血）；任何血里面的毒都可以从这解；所有皮肤病都可以通过委中穴放血治疗；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081742-v3bthze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081742-v3bthze","updated":"20230928081742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"140.1、委中放血：病人垫脚斜面向墙，用水或酒拍打委中穴，能看到青筋冒出来，用放血针放血；（对于有传染性的病，放血时要带手套，避免被感染）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-quwqodm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-quwqodm","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"141、委阳穴（足太阳经络穴）：淋巴肿大；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-eap65ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-eap65ry","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"142、承筋穴：筋挛；抽筋；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-q112cr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-q112cr5","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"143、承山穴：抽筋（用力按压承山穴能缓解）； 痔疮大出血（灸承山或针扎承山，针扎孔最或灸孔最穴）；脚无力；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-p0xmbv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-p0xmbv2","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"144、痔疮痛：下长强、下承山、下孔最穴；还不行，就天应穴放血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-e1bhpsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-e1bhpsi","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"145、脚无力：承山穴（承山穴下针，一定要透到骨头，尤其是抽筋）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-91au7eg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-91au7eg","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"146、摔跤尾椎骨受伤：看承山穴如有青筋，放血针放血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-wcoirgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-wcoirgq","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"147、行走问题：飞扬穴（可足三里+飞扬穴+承山穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-a4zxi65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-a4zxi65","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"148、昆仑穴（孕妇不可下针，会落胎）：后项项背痛；生娃后胎盘不会落；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-fo6iqts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-fo6iqts","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"149、消积穴（奇穴）：体内有东西积聚、痞块、累积到了，都可对治；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-fhpu0it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-fhpu0it","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"149.1、消积穴如有压痛感，说明体内有积块；（平常筋上是没有穴道的，消积穴是个特例）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-b5rfoxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-b5rfoxf","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"150、脚后跟痛：仆参穴；六味地黄丸；水泉穴（对侧疗法）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-f5pekws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-f5pekws","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"151、癫痫：隔姜灸阳跷脉、申脉（白天发痫病）；隔姜灸照海穴（晚上发痫病）；鸠尾+人中+涌泉（发病时）；百会、魄户、神庭、劳宫穴、神门穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-1w2hst8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-1w2hst8","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"151.1、治疗中间看眼中的鸡脚筋，如果鸡脚筋在慢慢消退，代表治疗的手法在正确的路上；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-kqk79m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-kqk79m5","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"151.2、有一句古话叫不知人中穴，不知治癫痫；涌泉可让头脑清醒，檀中可让痰水去掉；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-no802kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-no802kl","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"152、灸到眼球的鸡脚筋没碰到黑眼球灸不会发病，彻底治疗就把鸡脚筋都灸退；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-b1577c5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-b1577c5","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"153、束骨穴：膀胱经有疮，脓疮脓疡，膀胱经实症；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-84u7ox2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-84u7ox2","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"154、胎位不正：针至阴穴（效果很好，隔天胎位就正了）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-7oe1k06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-7oe1k06","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"155、头顶痛：束骨穴；百会穴；涌泉穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-uv2a65f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-uv2a65f","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"156、脑震荡（脑震荡时，然谷穴会凸起青筋）、脚不能落地：然谷穴放血（如放血后有恶心感，扎公孙）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-bh0tfzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-bh0tfzm","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"156.1、然谷大穴是有名的急救大穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-rq21wjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-rq21wjl","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"157、小便排不出来：大钟穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-a50nmq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-a50nmq2","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"158、月经不来：水泉穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-yznsblp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-yznsblp","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"159、一切喉咙病：列缺穴+照海穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-tc7ch0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-tc7ch0i","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"159.1、扁桃腺发炎：扁桃腺肿大，三寸针刺破扁桃腺，再刺照海穴，痛感立竿见影消失；针刺完，彻底解决可 夏枯草五钱+带壳生鸡蛋，两碗水煮一碗水，煮完把蛋也吃了，扁桃腺终生不犯；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-asqr3x0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-asqr3x0","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"159.2、妇人逆经，每个月固定流鼻血：照海穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-oa8ozt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-oa8ozt7","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"160、灸复溜穴（肾经母穴；日常养生可关元+复溜）：脚冷；脚水肿；补肾；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-2xoozfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-2xoozfs","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"161、交信穴：女子月事不止，滴漏不止，子宫颈下垂；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-j3rzzff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-j3rzzff","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"162、筑宾穴：肚脐以下的消炎解毒穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-4sghcv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-4sghcv2","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"162.1、曲池穴：肚脐以上的消炎解毒穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-sibbzsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-sibbzsf","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"163.3、全身痒：合谷+曲池（上半身痒）+筑宾穴+血海穴+三阴交（下半身），共十针；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-t7u10bb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-t7u10bb","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"164、牛皮藓：血郄穴+委中穴放血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-2iiimu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-2iiimu7","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"165、下半身水肿（肾脏病）：水分穴+水道穴+三皇穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-i3cvr6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-i3cvr6x","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"166、心痛：郄门穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-12875xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-12875xd","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"167、间使穴：手麻；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-5rm9v9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-5rm9v9t","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"168、内关穴：可止吐；也可催吐；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081805-g5obr3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081805-g5obr3d","updated":"20230928081805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"168.1、心藏神，内关穴位于心包经，如需止吐或催吐，按住内关穴，用意念让自己别吐或吐；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081816-y5bpy1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081816-y5bpy1n","updated":"20230928081823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"169、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"公孙+内关"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：胃、心胸相关的方面的症状，如呼吸短气、气喘、咳嗽、心脏痛、胃痛等；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081816-9hasr5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081816-9hasr5q","updated":"20230928081816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"170、频繁打嗝（中焦气弱或气无）："}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-bi36yxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-bi36yxy","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"171、白内障、内翳：液门穴；中渚穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-42qry78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-42qry78","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"172、消渴：阳池穴透大陵穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-l5l14xe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-l5l14xe","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"173、小儿受惊吓（经常哭闹不止）：揉两边的耳轮（恐伤肾，肾主耳）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-g54zzlw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-g54zzlw","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"173.1、如小儿眼睛往上吊的，揉两边耳轮耳垂的时候往下拉扯几下，眼睛就会慢慢回正；如眼球往下吊，则揉上面耳轮往上提；如眼睛斜向左，则揉拉对侧也就是右侧的耳轮，眼睛就会慢慢回正，同理，眼睛斜向右，揉拉左侧耳轮；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-caan33y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-caan33y","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"174、背痛（横道痛）：如胸膈痛扎外关穴；（第十四椎为命门，命门以下称之为带脉，命门以上称之为阳维脉；）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-lho195u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-lho195u","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"175、背痛（膀胱经）：虚症扎委中穴；实症扎束骨穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-4x6da73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-4x6da73","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"176、便秘（寒热型便秘皆可）：支沟穴+照海穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ide59yn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ide59yn","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"177、支沟穴（开沟渠）：妇人难产、胎衣不落、漏下不止、任脉不通，不怀孕；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-gh9w2rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-gh9w2rl","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"178、 三焦经部分症状：不能梳头；夹菜放不到嘴里甩走；手臂不能举；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-jlunmaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-jlunmaj","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"178.1、手不能侧举，是手阳明大肠经；手肘不能向后放，是小肠经问题；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-dby1ora","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-dby1ora","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"178.2、手不能拧毛巾：养老透间使穴，透针后，六经会归位（三焦经、小肠经、心经、心包经、小肠经、肺经）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-nus9mi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-nus9mi2","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"179、中风急救（耳朵后面有很多鸡爪筋）：耳朵后面的穴位放血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-2zinz2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-2zinz2r","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"180、常用眼科放血：攒竹穴；丝竹空穴；瞳子髎穴；耳尖；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-yc6m27p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-yc6m27p","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"181、眉棱骨痛：眉棱点（属气穴，阴陵泉往下一寸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-3t74s3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-3t74s3q","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"182、耳朵流脓：麝香矾石散；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ifz3mei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ifz3mei","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"183、耳门穴：各种耳鸣；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ffqalcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ffqalcm","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"184、视物倒置如b看成d（左右翻转，幼时频繁呕吐导致，胆汁吐出导致胆囊翻转）：日月穴（胆募日月）+胆俞穴；胆经母穴侠溪穴；胆经原穴络穴治疗；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-shd7t3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-shd7t3p","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"185、瞳子髎放血：耳朵、眼睛发炎、虹膜、角膜炎；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-23gfn58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-23gfn58","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"186、瞳子髎透率骨：头痛（胆经位置，透的时候把头皮拉起来一点点穿）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-hy6hfei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-hy6hfei","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"187、阳白透鱼腰：眼睛近视、阳白穴痛（皮肤拉起来，针从阳白穴透到眉毛的中间）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-220mu56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-220mu56","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"188、头临泣穴、目窗穴：风泪；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ni4va7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ni4va7p","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"189、风池穴：鼻窦炎、鼻蓄脓、鼻塞；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-q8fry8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-q8fry8j","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"189.1、风池穴下法：朝对侧颧髎穴下针，如扎左风池穴，则针头朝右颧髎穴刺入，扎右则反之；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-jj4npox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-jj4npox","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"189.2、针下的准确的话，下右边风池则左边鼻孔通；左边风池则右边鼻孔通；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-i11syhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-i11syhi","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"189.3、风池穴可对症刮痧、拔罐，如项强；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-krobxz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-krobxz4","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"190、胸腔遭受重击或有淤血或胸内伤：肩井穴+足三里穴；（孕妇不可下肩颈，会落胎）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-0cq1fsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-0cq1fsh","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"191、肩项强痛、酸：后溪穴+申脉穴通用酸痛感即去掉大半，再加肩井穴+足三里即消；天柱穴、大抒穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-hjffl0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-hjffl0j","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"192、申脉穴（灸）：癫痫昼发；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-t7i62ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-t7i62ys","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"193、环腰的腰痛：带脉病（外关穴+临泣穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-zz3wb84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-zz3wb84","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"194、华佗夹脊（督脉旁开五分的一条经）腰痛：足三里+临泣；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-vs6a3k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-vs6a3k3","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"195、半身不遂，中风：环跳穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-z06oxld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-z06oxld","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"196、中医瘫痪大穴：风市穴（下风市穴时，一般是深针，碰到骨头）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ryzj8go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ryzj8go","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"196.1、脚、膝盖麻木不仁、中风、膝盖无力（风市穴+阴市穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ljq1csz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ljq1csz","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"197、任何膝盖痛：鹤顶穴+2膝眼穴+阳陵泉透阴陵泉（也可不透针，阳陵泉阴陵泉各一针，共五针，效果相对会差些）；（较严重可加针膝关穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-l5qm5e7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-l5qm5e7","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"198、胆石点穴（位于阳陵泉正下一寸）：胆结石；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ma71gj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ma71gj9","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"199、肾石点穴（交信穴和太溪穴的中间）：肾结石；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-b7304tn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-b7304tn","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"200、疯狗咬伤：隔姜灸咬伤的位置+灸外丘穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-lixbg6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-lixbg6w","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"201、任何筋骨问题：绝骨穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-c05ku77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-c05ku77","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"202、脚踝扭伤：商丘穴透丘墟穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-lwauukg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-lwauukg","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"203、带脉病：临泣穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-2elu76p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-2elu76p","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"204、乳癌、乳房硬块、脚皮干：第五会穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-9eehyik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-9eehyik","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"205、睾丸高度不一致：扎大敦穴（左边下垂扎右边大敦穴，右边下垂扎左边大敦穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-n0s8exh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-n0s8exh","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"206、大敦穴：妇人血崩；子宫下垂；疝气；阴部病；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-146bbkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-146bbkv","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"207、（肝实症）1到3点不能睡眠、右肋痛、人会发黄：行间穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-86yda34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-86yda34","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"208、太冲穴：女子漏下不止；便血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-iwcp6ip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-iwcp6ip","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"209、阴挺不下，为肝实：行间穴（肝经子穴）；蠡沟穴（肝经络穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ybe4kba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ybe4kba","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"210、曲泉穴：阴部痒；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-62lbfpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-62lbfpl","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"211、肝一、肝二、肝三（奇穴，位于侧面膝盖中点到盆骨中间位置，前后一寸各一穴，共三穴，两腿皆有，共六穴）：肝硬化；肝癌；肝腹水；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-s1c40ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-s1c40ct","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"212、助孕：足五里穴（隔姜灸）；阴廉穴（隔姜灸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-fs2nosq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-fs2nosq","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"213、肚脐旁的奔豚：章门穴（斜刺，不要直刺）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-448c844","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-448c844","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"214、月经期感冒，病毒同奶水进入子宫，热入血室：扎期门穴；或小柴胡；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-ta0k7co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-ta0k7co","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"215、身热不已，月经不来：腰俞穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-uct70au","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-uct70au","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"216、精子带血（小肠火不够）：灸关元；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-rh4495l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-rh4495l","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"217、振声（重复讲着同样的话）：是一种虚症；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-qde4ist","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-qde4ist","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"218、喉病（任何喉病）：列缺穴+照海穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-yf1q30q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-yf1q30q","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"219、阴阳分离：外关透内关（通生死桥）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-eip1w20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-eip1w20","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"220、 皮肤病：病患处梅花针锤击放血+委中放血，再下针如合谷、曲池、三阴交、血海、筑宾穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081836-iuk2tnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081836-iuk2tnw","updated":"20230928081836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"221、麻痹：梅花针点刺麻痹位置，放血活血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-ebpf7iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-ebpf7iz","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"222、头部与脑瘤治症：头顶痛、全头痛（整个头痛，针扎百会穴，还痛加扎涌泉穴）；偏头痛（治胆经，下对侧合谷穴+同侧太阳透率谷，如偏头痛兼恶心呕吐，可加针中脘、内关、足三里等穴）；耳后痛（初痛扎天井穴，久痛扎中渚穴）；前额痛、印堂痛（扎中脘穴）；眉棱骨痛（扎对侧阴陵泉下一寸的奇穴）；后脑痛（扎天柱穴，初痛扎束骨穴，久痛扎委中穴）；脑瘤（不一定有痛感，但全身抖动，筋挛，眼睛上吊；全蝎+蜈蚣等量烤干打粉，放胶囊服用，下针则百会+涌泉）；太冲穴也能治头痛，肝开窍在眼，肝经络在脑袋后面；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-7atdw8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-7atdw8k","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"222.1、百会+涌泉是导引之法，百会是导，定位，涌泉是引，将之引下来；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-2cd043g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-2cd043g","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"223、眼症与睛中法：赤红肿痛（湿热，攒足、丝竹空、耳尖、太阳三棱针点刺放血）；近视\\生翳\\白内障（睛明+阳白+三间+养老+光明）；让眼睛变好（俞募治疗，肝俞+期门穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-rqlp1wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-rqlp1wf","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"224、治鼻症：鼻息肉（合谷+迎香穴透内迎香穴）；鼻子不通（扎通天穴）；鼻科大穴（合谷、通天、迎香、上星）；灸上星穴（米粒灸，通鼻、化脓、过敏）；通鼻（下对侧的风池穴）；肺经俞募治疗；鼻血（合谷、天府，如下针不止，得考虑癌症或其他问题）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-491aryv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-491aryv","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"225、治耳症（肾主耳）：耳鸣耳聋耳痛（久鸣为虚，补肾为主，可针肾俞、志室、复溜穴，章门+京门穴；耳门、听宫、听会三穴轮刺；实症则下然谷、外关、支沟穴；）；化脓发炎（麝香矾石散；）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-fddn5dj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-fddn5dj","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"226、面部中风（未歪的一侧才是患侧）：地仓透颊车、太阳穴（健侧下针）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-4gqh17d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-4gqh17d","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"226.1、先扎健侧，后扎患侧，等脸正了以后，扎人中、承浆穴，起固定作用；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-idctvtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-idctvtp","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"226.2、半身瘫痪的口流涎（扎地仓穴穿过肉，来回插提数次，次日会有改善，大概重复两三次就不会流涎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-lo5ihmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-lo5ihmr","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"226.3、面部中风起因：大汗后吹风或吹冷气；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-queg18p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-queg18p","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"227、治舌症与扁桃腺炎：久咳（舌头放蒜片，膈蒜灸）；中风、舌强不语（舌头翻起来， 三菱针放血金津穴与玉液穴）；舌肿胀、舌癌（大陵、神门、通里、内关穴、列缺穴、巨阙穴、照海穴，金津、玉液穴亦可放血）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-isi7fhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-isi7fhx","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"228、碰到积块、硬块，一律采取消导的方式能好；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-sxpreo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-sxpreo2","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"228、扁桃腺炎：天应放血，下针取穴列缺、照海，近取穴可针天突穴；扁桃腺久病，扁桃腺硬，直接针刺扁桃腺放血；喉癌（同上，治法一样，可针刺列缺、照海，少商、商阳放血）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-kqzr3f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-kqzr3f7","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"229、瘿瘤（即甲状腺，心悸、潮热、手抖、盗汗、眼睛凸出）：扎少海、人迎、照海、列缺、天突；日常饮食可以多吃海带海藻；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-piwdeak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-piwdeak","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"230、肺虚（气虚、倦怠无力、面色苍白、呼吸短促、主呼）：太渊、肺俞、中府穴、足三里、檀中（灸）、脾俞穴、章门穴；（强土补气）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-wxpew22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-wxpew22","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"230.1、肺实（热咳、浓痰、面赤、皮干、）：肺俞、中府穴；尺泽、檀中（针）、肾俞、金门、然谷穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-n34wwy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-n34wwy8","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"231、内伤：肺脏内伤（先肩井、后足三里，导引法，活血化瘀，大便会黑或带血排淤血）；五脏气乱、脉乱型内伤（天柱穴+大抒穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-e89tn8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-e89tn8v","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"232、肺癌：肺俞、中府透云门；脾俞、中脘、足三里（胃气不绝，病人就不会死）；孔最穴（肺经郄穴，止痛）；地机、三阴交（女人得肺癌可从调月经调奶水角度出发）；公孙、内关、膈蒜灸舌头或肺俞（咳嗽）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-bmcnatw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-bmcnatw","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"232.1、肺癌早期：咳清白泡沫痰；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-p4eadi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-p4eadi6","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"233、肺痨：灸痨（四花灸：2肺俞、2膏肓共四穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-hlf8vdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-hlf8vdy","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"233.1、肺痨、痨症的人易累，脉大血管大；痨病都可以用四花灸；灸的时候要灸到肚子能听到咕噜咕噜的水声，代表艾草药性到了；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-bennfnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-bennfnq","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"234、肺积水（但坐不得卧）：膈俞穴（第七椎，至阳穴外开一寸半）；檀中、鸠尾、乳根；水沟、阳谷、沟谷、后溪、照海（通利水道，排肺水）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-uscrdt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-uscrdt5","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"234.1、肺积水（伤寒结胸）：黄连一钱磨粉、巴豆八颗去壳，两者相合（戴手套，巴豆接触易烧伤），将揉成的泥饼置于肚脐上，艾灸7壮，灸到病人肠鸣即肚子叫就停，停止后病人会上厕所上吐下泻；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-2ht9fd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-2ht9fd2","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"235、胸肋积水：外关、临泣；水分、水道、乳根、大包穴（利水排水）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-1s0hkj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-1s0hkj6","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"235.1、大部分积水都在左肋，少部分右肋，可以躺下去睡，不能躺左边睡，左边会痛；（左血右气）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-4htaz4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-4htaz4z","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"236、心脏刺痛（淤血堵到）：巨阙、少府穴、神门穴、劳宫穴、关元穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-j6cg0sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-j6cg0sw","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"236.1、处方处理活血化瘀时，要善用热药；用针则要用很热的穴道如关元；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-n8hqu2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-n8hqu2p","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"237、心脏闷痛（气机堵到）：公孙、内关、天突、巨阙、关元；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-o7fa1xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-o7fa1xw","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"237.1、不论气阻淤阻，先下公孙、内关；巨阙、关元下针即去掉；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-jt40j27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-jt40j27","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"238、心律不整：关元；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-5onlpoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-5onlpoh","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"239、中指在平面滑动，会有被锐刺刺中的感觉：心肌梗塞（扎对侧关冲穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-kptgwyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-kptgwyv","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"240、（急救）心脏病发，心脏脉没有，胸口还有余温时，下少府穴心脏应该就跳起来，没有反应就加针下关元穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-t3jctfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-t3jctfi","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"240.1、心脏病刚开始就会有一段时间预兆，失眠，因为心藏神，心管上焦，所以手指尖会麻，因为心跟小肠相表里，所以大便不规则，下利或便秘，心脏火不够，小肠火少，脚就冰冷了；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-50yb1x1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-50yb1x1","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"241、乳癌（乳岩）：隔姜灸阿是穴（初期或凹下去或凸起或化脓，哪硬灸哪）；肩井穴+足三里（导引法，红肿硬；）；膺窗穴、乳根穴；以上为治症，根治要强心脏，通利奶水通路；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-cm9o85z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-cm9o85z","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"241.1、奶水来自月经，奶水又来自肺，因为肺为白；肺把白营养交与胸部乳房；乳癌成因是奶水没有消导下去；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-h6nqttx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-h6nqttx","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"241.2、导引法：肩井穴+足三里，肩井穴是个大穴，犹如人体的天窗，下肩井能让身体气从上打下来，力道很大，能破淤血硬块，下肩井穴要配合足三里穴使用，否则人可能会闷；肩井穴与足三里穴要对侧，如扎左肩井穴，就要扎右足三里，右肩井穴就扎左足三里穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-wnf3hy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-wnf3hy7","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"241.3、更年期，没有月经不代表奶水不来，奶水照样来，所以很多妇女更年期停经后乳房会变大，这种情况要进行通便，通利奶水排掉对治；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-3ybkzbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-3ybkzbb","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"241.4、更年期潮热：睡觉靠左边睡（左血右气，所以靠左睡下血上气，气凉则不易燥热）；强心；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-v1ztg3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-v1ztg3o","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"241.5、判断心脏功能恢复方法：每天都有排便、一觉到天亮、手脚不麻不冰；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-7vu7fg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-7vu7fg6","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"242、癃闭（小便不通利）、霍乱下痢：隔盐灸（炒过凉过后再放肚脐上灸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-izccvi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-izccvi7","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"243、流脓水（腥臭味脓水）：面粉（白面）+硫磺（石硫磺）+大蒜三者等量制成面团，放在脓头即有流脓水的地方灸，灸一次换一个面饼，灸至少21壮；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-n7gqbkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-n7gqbkz","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"243.1、流脓水（无味的脓水）：膈附灸（膈生附子，没有生附子就用炮附子，炮软使用，放在脓头即有流脓水的地方）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-r8rj22i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-r8rj22i","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"243.2、硫磺市面上分为石硫磺还有土硫磺，石硫磺像刚出生的小鸡一样淡黄色的，土硫磺是深褐色的，非常毒，中医伤科外科在用；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-hnh2x0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-hnh2x0o","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"243.3、阴阳律：阴升阳降，阳进阴退，硫磺热而不燥，行阳力量强，脓水属阴，硫磺一灸阳进阴自然就退了；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-0o1rj9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-0o1rj9j","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"244、青春痘：针合谷、曲池；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-2ssdbu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-2ssdbu4","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"245、黄病如黄疸：至阳穴（治黄病著名穴道）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-h0gbn1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-h0gbn1r","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"245.1、肝跟脾犯黄病都有黄，肝的黄为青黄，脾的黄为土黄；肝脾有黄病胃口都会不好，肝多了一项恶心呕吐症状；肚脐以下为少腹，脾主少腹，肝络阴器，肝病小便很黄，肝病1-3点睡不着或醒来；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-54yu6k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-54yu6k6","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"246、身肿肚大无力肌肉萎缩（原因肝克脾，先固肾）；三皇穴（陵泉、地机、三阴交）；章门穴（脾之募，脏会章门）、脾俞穴、 肾俞穴、京门穴（肾之募）；复溜（肾本穴）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-ovfmfx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-ovfmfx3","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"247、上牙痛：手阳明大肠经在管，合谷穴；翳风穴、颊车穴、下关穴（近取穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-or3pz1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-or3pz1l","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"247.1、下牙痛：足阳明胃经在管，内庭穴；翳风穴、颊车穴、下关穴（近取穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-akx7qxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-akx7qxi","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"248、朝食暮吐症：针中脘穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-4ipcrjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-4ipcrjl","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"249、盲肠或阑尾破掉，食物残渣渗漏（不动不痛，一动就痛）：肘尖穴（灸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-ejomxhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-ejomxhh","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"250、 消渴、燥渴：天突穴、关元穴（加强小肠火，升提津液）、天枢穴（大肠蠕动速度恢复正常）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-n0np5xq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-n0np5xq","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"251、痞块（肝硬化、肝癌、脾脏癌、胃癌等）：痞根穴、消积穴、隔姜灸；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-84bk6bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-84bk6bc","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"251.1、中医认为，阴会累积，痞块是阴累积而成，所以对治痞块就是要以行阳角度出发，最好是固胃气，行阳气；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-vpembwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-vpembwu","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"252、肝结石（割掉胆导致）：天枢穴、期门穴（肝之募）、肝俞穴、胆俞穴、日月；隔姜灸痛处；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-heqn670","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-heqn670","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"253、大便干燥（燥矢）：强心（让热进入小肠）；强脾（让湿进入小肠）；支沟穴+照海穴(寒热症皆可)；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-gnkpswo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-gnkpswo","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"253.1、便如羊矢（大便如羊粪一颗颗的，脾约）：支沟+照海穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-evybzfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-evybzfq","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"254、惊吓导致的心脏部位奔豚：巨阙+心俞（强心角度出手）、少府、神门、内关、劳宫；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-06y665w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-06y665w","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"255、痔疮：刺破放血用火罐吸（外痔）；尾椎骨往上按，一寸一寸往上按，有压痛点，灸压痛点（内痔、肠漏、下血、大肠炎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-xjzlzjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-xjzlzjb","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"256、大肠癌：痞根穴、消积穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-a2gk9cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-a2gk9cr","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"257、鼻血不止：天府穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-whh10q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-whh10q1","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"257.1、吐血不止：中脘、内关穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-gol5b9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-gol5b9f","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"257.2、肠漏下血、月经下血：隐白穴（留针20分钟，当天或隔天止掉，左右都下）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-jutc5dh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-jutc5dh","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"258、白带：针隐白穴、临泣穴、临泣穴、三阴交、水道、归来、曲骨、天应穴、白环俞穴（赤带，味重，湿热下注）；跟赤带一样，不同的是可以加灸（白带，无味，寒湿下注）；阴陵泉、地机、三阴交；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-buzvf1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-buzvf1g","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"259、灸肩井穴+灸足三里：对治所有淋巴结肿胀；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-somdgsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-somdgsd","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"260、安胎：针隐白穴、三阴交（脾统血，血旺安胎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081853-fvwl6ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081853-fvwl6ti","updated":"20230928081853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"261、喘：定喘穴（奇穴，位于大椎穴旁开五分）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081904-5hlu9ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081904-5hlu9ro","updated":"20230928081908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"262、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"身体保养：每天整个耳朵按摩二十分钟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081904-r5uzs44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081904-r5uzs44","updated":"20230928081904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"263、醒酒：耳垂中间或耳垂放血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-k34aeey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-k34aeey","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"264、耳朵化脓\\化脓：曲池；筑宾穴（身体结痂化脓）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-wbswk6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-wbswk6k","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"265、梦游：期门穴+肝俞穴；（强肾，水生木）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-ddp2yxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-ddp2yxi","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"265.1、肝藏魂，人能熟睡是因为魂归肝，如梦游，说明魂不归肝（虚症），对治，肝俞穴+期门穴；也可用十三鬼穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-3vxdrh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-3vxdrh4","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"266、湿疹（按照经络取其郄穴）：如在 鼠蹊部，鼠蹊部只有肝经经过，所以取肝经郄穴；筑宾穴（下半身解毒穴，无论在何经，筑宾穴都有效）；新鲜艾叶煮水擦痒的地方，能止痒；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-gft0wbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-gft0wbb","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"266.1、中医对麻、痒的感觉都定为虚症；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-cb174hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-cb174hu","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"267、骨质酥松（骨有病，起于环跳痛）：肾俞穴+京门穴；针复溜穴；饮食上多喝骨头汤；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-l2jeiyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-l2jeiyp","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"268、木舌症（舌硬不能言语）：舌头金津穴+玉液穴放血；列缺、照海、廉泉；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-snrwpwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-snrwpwy","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"269、委中放血：可以沾点米酒拍委中处，有淤血血管出来后放血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-6ljcuby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-6ljcuby","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"270、手臂或环跳或膝盖骨等容易脱臼：扎大抒穴、绝骨、肾俞、京门、天应穴（痛的地方下针）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-1s8mabr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-1s8mabr","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"271、急性腰扭伤：扭伤穴（曲池下两寸）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-20wnera","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-20wnera","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"271.1、脚扭伤：解穴（膝盖头上方一寸，边下针边扭动受伤的位置，会慢慢好）；灵龟八法；子午流注；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-uhwm2pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-uhwm2pf","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"272、整个膝盖痛：膝五针（内膝眼、外膝眼、鹤顶穴、阴陵泉穴、阳陵泉穴，阴陵泉穴和阳陵泉穴下针，一般都是用三寸针，在阳陵泉穴透刺到阴陵泉穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-fpz25sj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-fpz25sj","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"272.1、膝五针：针下膝眼时不捻转，都是用插提法（雀啄术），捻转很容易会伤到膝盖，因为有油囊在里面；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-gfdy8ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-gfdy8ep","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"273、手指头关节痛，手握不起来：合谷透劳宫穴；整个手关节痛（下同侧）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-bic1gqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-bic1gqg","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"273.1、中风手张不开：合谷透后溪；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-v5iaql8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-v5iaql8","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"274、急症：子午流注；灵龟八法；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-4tl8uf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-4tl8uf3","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"275、化骨（如脚侧关节突出不能穿鞋）：川穹（磨粉放在棉布包内，敷在突出位置）；报刺突出的位置；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-puomngo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-puomngo","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"276、五十肩（手抬不起来）：往前抬不起来，大肠经问题；往后抬不起来，小肠经问题；手不能往上抬，三焦经问题；（如以上三经扎针了还有点痛，再加上条口透承山穴）"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-s5e9cgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-s5e9cgd","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"277、眼睛保养（肝藏血）：早晨起来看远边的绿景；合谷是气穴，两个合谷穴互搓，搓热后敷在眼睛上，通过气补眼；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-drg6fde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-drg6fde","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"278、肌肉膶动、眼皮跳动（体内水泛滥导致，可强脾，因为土克水）：阴陵泉、地机、三阴交；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-fcn435b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-fcn435b","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"279、心律不齐：关元穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-dwnini2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-dwnini2","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"280、肚子大：天应下针，灸三焦油网募穴，石门、阴交都可以灸（石门阴交灸会有绝孕的效果，需注意）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-uxj1j9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-uxj1j9q","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"281、晕眩：（蹲下去站起来，眼前一黑，属于贫血）；（蹲下去站起来，天旋地转，颜色不变，肾主骨，骨有髓，脑为髓海，肾主水，横膈膜有水堵住，水停心下，水下不来人就会有强烈暝眩）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-kcaymrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-kcaymrg","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"282、皮肤病\\湿疹\\风疹\\藓类：合谷、血池、血海、三阴交、筑宾（必取）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-nalftfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-nalftfo","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"283、膏肓痛（针法无法对治，只能放血治疗）：膏肓放血（放吸血虫吸；或把皮肤捏起来，放血针刺破，然后用火罐吸血，当当出的血的颜色变成了正常的鲜红色就取下火罐）；委中放血（较慢）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-fvkba7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-fvkba7k","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"283.1、放血记得带手套，不要接触到血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928081926-hx9ekk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928081926-hx9ekk2","updated":"20230928081926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"284、酒槽鼻：酒槽鼻需放血治疗；"}]},{"ID":"20231206191221-nue3pzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206191221-nue3pzo","updated":"20231206191233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"285、灸足三里：长寿；"}]},{"ID":"20231206191234-40lyipw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231206191234-40lyipw","updated":"20231218094712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"286、通尿：水分、水道、中极穴（膀胱募穴）；"}]},{"ID":"20231218094713-69b1ysc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231218094713-69b1ysc"}}]}